{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Journey: creatures of the old world, Outland and Northrend spawn at their journey levels",
  "contract": "Requires mod-coa-content-scaling with CoAContentScaling.Enable=1, Progression.Mode=Journey, TBC.Enable=1 and WotLK.Enable=1 at the default journey shape, and CoA.CreatureScaling.Enable=0 (conf/verify-all-scaling.json). The creature templates are rewritten at startup by the map most of their spawns are on. Coyote (834, Westfall, authored 10-11) is old-world content: Classic(10) = Classic(11) = 7. Starving Helboar (16879, Hellfire Peninsula, 58-59) is Outland's: Outland(58) = 30, Outland(59) = 31. Giant Tidecrawler (23929, Northrend, 68-69) is Northrend's: Northrend(68) = 40, Northrend(69) = 42. Native levels are read, not a character's view.",
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "scout",
      "race": 2,
      "class": 1,
      "level": 60
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "action": "set_phase",
      "actor": "scout",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "action": "teleport",
      "actor": "scout",
      "map": 0,
      "x": -9742.64,
      "y": 971.8,
      "z": 30.14,
      "o": 0.0
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "action": "assert",
      "label": "Westfall Coyote: spawned at the journey's levels 7-7",
      "actor": "scout",
      "metric": "nearby_creature_count",
      "entry": 834,
      "min_level": 7,
      "max_level": 7,
      "min": 1,
      "within_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "action": "assert",
      "label": "Westfall Coyote: none above 7",
      "actor": "scout",
      "metric": "nearby_creature_count",
      "entry": 834,
      "min_level": 8,
      "max_level": 255,
      "equals": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "teleport",
      "actor": "scout",
      "map": 530,
